SUMMARY:FAME kit 01/10 · X + Facebook · Get paid by link
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 1 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Get paid by link\n\nCARD (open\, then l
 ong press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-
 assets/main/kits/get-paid-by-link.jpg\n\nX POST\n_________________________
 _____\n\nA freelancer should not have to explain a wallet to get paid.\n\n
 FAME payment requests are one link. You set the amount\, you send it howev
 er you already talk to the client\, and they pay it.\n\nIf they are not on
  FAME\, the same link invites them in. Nobody installs anything before agr
 eeing to pay.\n\nTen cents flat\, settled straight to you.\n\nalgofame.org
 \n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n_____________________
 _________\n\nGetting paid should not be the hard part of the job.\n\nWith 
 FAME you create a payment request\, set the amount\, and send the link. Yo
 ur client opens it and pays. That is the whole thing.\n\nThey do not need 
 an account first. If they have never heard of FAME\, the same link gets th
 em started\, and the money still comes straight to you.\n\nOur fee is ten 
 cents\, flat\, whatever the invoice.\n\nalgofame.org\n____________________
 __________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/g
 et-paid-by-link.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
