SUMMARY:FAME kit 02/10 · X + Facebook · Guardians: envelopes and password
 s
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 2 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Guardians: envelopes and passwords\n\nC
 ARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/b
 ilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/guardians-envelopes.jpg\n\nX POST\n____
 __________________________\n\nA guardian is one person with two powers.\n\
 nA recovery code gets somebody back into their account.\n\nAn envelope pre
 -approves one cash withdrawal. One agent\, one day\, one limit\, revocable
  until it is used.\n\nThe guardians page now leads with whoever is waiting
  on you right now\, because someone standing at a counter cannot wait for 
 you to scroll.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBO
 OK POST\n______________________________\n\nIf you are somebody's guardian\
 , there are two things you can hand them.\n\nA recovery code\, which gets 
 them back into their account if they are locked out.\n\nAn envelope\, whic
 h approves one cash withdrawal in advance. One shop\, one day\, one limit.
  You can cancel it right up until it is used.\n\nWe rebuilt the page so th
 e person actually waiting on you appears first\, above everything else. So
 meone standing at a counter should never be at the bottom of a list.\n\nal
 gofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/g
 uardians-envelopes.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
