BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-05@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260805T150000Z
DTEND:20260805T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 03/10 · X + Facebook · Cutting off an agent vs ending th
 e tier
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 3 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Cutting off an agent vs ending the tier
 \n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.
 com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/cut-off-vs-end.jpg\n\nX POST\n____
 __________________________\n\nTwo ways to leave a counter\, and only one i
 s reversible.\n\nA guardian can cut off a member's agent alone\, without b
 eing asked. The vault carries forward\, so the same four digits work at an
 y other shop tomorrow.\n\nEnding the assisted tier is final\, and only the
  member can do it\, from their own session.\n\nA guardian is the person wh
 o can help you. Never the person who can strand you.\n\nalgofame.org\n____
 __________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n___________________________
 ___\n\nThere are two different ways to walk away from a shop\, and we deli
 berately gave them to different people.\n\nA guardian can cut off the coun
 ter someone is using\, on their own\, without waiting to be asked. Nothing
  is lost. The same PIN works at any other shop the next day. That is what 
 makes it safe to give a guardian.\n\nEnding the assisted tier completely i
 s permanent\, and for someone without a smartphone it means losing access 
 to their money until they get one. So only the member can do that\, and on
 ly from their own session.\n\nA guardian is the person who can help you\, 
 not the person who can strand you.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________
 ________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/c
 ut-off-vs-end.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:FAME daily kit
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
