UID:fame-kit-2026-08-06@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260806T150000Z
DTEND:20260806T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 04/10 · X + Facebook · CI and the reliability week
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 4 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: CI and the reliability week\n\nCARD (op
 en\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalpro
 f/algofame-assets/main/kits/ci-reliability.jpg\n\nX POST\n________________
 ______________\n\nA bug in our money logic once shipped and sat live for a
  day before a human caught it.\n\nHumans do not run on the next change. Te
 sts do.\n\nEvery push now runs typecheck\, every workspace test including 
 the SQL gates\, and every build. No secrets in CI\, so it can never touch 
 real funds. Red does not deploy.\n\nFour reliability fixes landed this wee
 k on top of it.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEB
 OOK POST\n______________________________\n\nSome honesty about how we buil
 d this.\n\nLast month a bug in our savings-circle logic got through review
  and stayed live for a day before somebody spotted it. Nothing was lost\, 
 but that was luck rather than process.\n\nThe fix was not to review harder
 . A person reviewing carefully today does not protect you from the change 
 somebody makes next month. So now every single push runs the full test sui
 te and every build automatically\, and anything failing simply does not go
  out.\n\nWe also turned that specific bug into a permanent test\, so it ca
 n never come back.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/c
 i-reliability.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:FAME daily kit
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-07@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260807T150000Z
DTEND:20260807T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 05/10 · X + Facebook · Circles\, organizer direct
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 5 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Circles\, organizer direct\n\nCARD (ope
 n\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof
 /algofame-assets/main/kits/circles-organizer.jpg\n\nX POST\n______________
 ________________\n\nMost savings circles need somebody to hold the pot.\n\
 nThat person is trusted\, and also exposed. If they are robbed\, or pressu
 red\, or simply unlucky\, everybody's money is in one place.\n\nFAME circl
 es have no pot. Each contribution goes straight to whoever is owed that ro
 und\, settled on chain\, visible to everyone in the circle.\n\nNobody has 
 to be trusted to pass it along.\n\nalgofame.org\n_________________________
 _____\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nThe oldest way
  to save together is for everyone to pay into a pot each month\, and one p
 erson takes the pot.\n\nIt works\, and it has one weak point. Somebody has
  to hold the money. That person carries a risk nobody asked them to carry\
 , and if anything happens to them it happens to everyone.\n\nFAME circles 
 remove the pot entirely. When your turn comes\, everyone pays you directly
 . The money never sits anywhere in between\, not even with us.\n\nEveryone
  in the circle can see who has paid and what is still owed\, so nobody has
  to chase anybody.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/c
 ircles-organizer.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:FAME daily kit
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
