UID:fame-kit-2026-08-10@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260810T150000Z
DTEND:20260810T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 06/10 · X + Facebook · Hybrid chat encryption
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 6 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Hybrid chat encryption\n\nCARD (open\, 
 then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/alg
 ofame-assets/main/kits/hybrid-chat-encryption.jpg\n\nX POST\n_____________
 _________________\n\nFAME chat agrees its keys two ways at once.\n\nX25519
 \, the classical scheme with decades of scrutiny behind it. And ML-KEM-768
 \, the post-quantum one NIST selected.\n\nAn attacker has to break both. E
 ither alone is a bet on which kind of computer arrives first\, and we woul
 d rather not bet.\n\nKeys are generated on your device and never reach us.
 \n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n_____
 _________________________\n\nA short note on how your messages in FAME are
  protected.\n\nEvery conversation key is agreed using two completely diffe
 rent methods at the same time. One is the standard used across the interne
 t today. The other is a newer one designed to survive quantum computers.\n
 \nAnyone trying to read your messages has to defeat both. Breaking one get
 s them nothing.\n\nWe do it this way because picking only one would be a g
 uess about which threat shows up first\, and your family's conversations a
 re not something to guess with.\n\nThe keys are made on your phone and nev
 er reach our servers.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/h
 ybrid-chat-encryption.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:FAME daily kit
