BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-11@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260811T150000Z
DTEND:20260811T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 07/10 · X + Facebook · An account is a person\, not a ha
 ndset
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 7 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: An account is a person\, not a handset\
 n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.c
 om/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/send-to-a-person.jpg\n\nX POST\n___
 ___________________________\n\nAn account is a person. Not a handset.\n\nS
 end to the number you already know. A phone number if they have one\, a FA
 ME number if they do not\, and the same field takes either without being t
 old which.\n\nA mother who owns no phone still has an account you can pay.
  That was always true in the code. Until this week our own words did not s
 ay so.\n\nHalf a percent to send\, whatever the amount and whatever the bo
 rder.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n
 ______________________________\n\nSending money to family should be as eas
 y as calling them\, and it should not depend on them owning a phone.\n\nIn
  FAME you send to a person. If they have a phone number\, use it. If they 
 do not own a phone at all\, they have a FAME number instead\, and it goes 
 in exactly the same box.\n\nThat has been true in the app since the day it
  shipped. Our own website was the last place still saying a phone number w
 as required\, and we fixed that this week.\n\nHalf a percent of what you s
 end\, whatever the border. Nothing from us when they collect it as cash.\n
 \nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/s
 end-to-a-person.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:FAME daily kit
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-12@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260812T150000Z
DTEND:20260812T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 08/10 · X + Facebook · Cancel a stuck cash-out
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 8 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Cancel a stuck cash-out\n\nCARD (open\,
  then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/al
 gofame-assets/main/kits/cancel-stuck-cashout.jpg\n\nX POST\n______________
 ________________\n\nThe honest test of a money app is what happens when it
  does not work.\n\nA cash-out at a counter can hang. Bad network\, a queue
 \, a change of mind. You can cancel it\, and nothing has moved.\n\nNo tran
 sfer\, no fee\, and the guardian's envelope is still intact\, so she can c
 ome back that afternoon.\n\nClosing the screen does not leave it hanging e
 ither.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\
 n______________________________\n\nWe spend a lot of time on the moments w
 hen things go wrong.\n\nPicture someone at a shop counter collecting cash\
 , and the network drops halfway through. Or the queue is long and she deci
 des to come back later.\n\nThat has to be safe. So a cash-out can be cance
 lled while it is in progress\, and nothing has moved. No money transferred
 \, no fee taken\, and the approval her son left is still there unused\, so
  she can walk back in that afternoon and do it properly.\n\nAn app that on
 ly works when everything goes right is not finished.\n\nalgofame.org\n____
 __________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/c
 ancel-stuck-cashout.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:FAME daily kit
END:VALARM
