BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-13@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260813T150000Z
DTEND:20260813T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 09/10 · X + Facebook · Half a percent\, the remittance g
 ap
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 9 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Half a percent\, the remittance gap\n\n
 CARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/
 bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/half-a-percent.jpg\n\nX POST\n________
 ______________________\n\nA flat fee sounds fair until somebody sends one 
 dollar and pays a tenth of it.\n\nFAME takes half a percent of what you se
 nd. Twenty dollars costs ten cents. Two hundred costs a dollar. Same rate 
 whatever the border.\n\nWe take nothing at all when it is collected as cas
 h\, and the network fee is ours.\n\nThe World Bank puts the regional avera
 ge at 8.78 percent.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nF
 ACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nHere is what it costs to s
 end 200 euros from Europe to Kenya or Tanzania.\n\nAcross all providers th
 e World Bank average is 8.78 percent. The family receives about 182 of you
 r 200 euros.\n\nWith FAME the fee is half a percent. One euro. If the mone
 y stays digital they keep 199. If they collect it as cash\, the agent char
 ges their own fee\, so the whole journey costs 2 to 4 euros and they recei
 ve 196 to 198. We take nothing at the counter.\n\nWe used to charge a flat
  ten cents. A flat fee sounds fair until somebody sends one dollar and pay
 s a tenth of it\, so we moved to a share of what is sent\, with a one cent
  minimum.\n\nSources: World Bank Remittance Prices Worldwide Q3 2025\, Mon
 ito\, provider tariffs. Ranges\, not live quotes.\n\nalgofame.org\n_______
 _______________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/h
 alf-a-percent.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 9 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinkedI
 n is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: Half a percent\, the remittance gap\n\n
 CARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/
 bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/half-a-percent.jpg\n\nX POST\n________
 ______________________\n\nA flat fee sounds fair until somebody sends one 
 dollar and pays a tenth of it.\n\nFAME takes half a percent of what you se
 nd. Twenty dollars costs ten cents. Two hundred costs a dollar. Same rate 
 whatever the border.\n\nWe take nothing at all when it is collected as cas
 h\, and the network fee is ours.\n\nThe World Bank puts the regional avera
 ge at 8.78 percent.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nF
 ACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nHere is what it costs to s
 end 200 euros from Europe to Kenya or Tanzania.\n\nAcross all providers th
 e World Bank average is 8.78 percent. The family receives about 182 of you
 r 200 euros.\n\nWith FAME the fee is half a percent. One euro. If the mone
 y stays digital they keep 199. If they collect it as cash\, the agent char
 ges their own fee\, so the whole journey costs 2 to 4 euros and they recei
 ve 196 to 198. We take nothing at the counter.\n\nWe used to charge a flat
  ten cents. A flat fee sounds fair until somebody sends one dollar and pay
 s a tenth of it\, so we moved to a share of what is sent\, with a one cent
  minimum.\n\nSources: World Bank Remittance Prices Worldwide Q3 2025\, Mon
 ito\, provider tariffs. Ranges\, not live quotes.\n\nalgofame.org\n_______
 _______________________\n
