BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-14@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 10/10 · X + Facebook · The community hive
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 10 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinked
 In is handled separately.\n\nTOPIC: The community hive\n\nCARD (open\, the
 n long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofa
 me-assets/main/kits/community-hive.jpg\n\nX POST\n________________________
 ______\n\nIn FAME a person is always a hexagon.\n\nYour rooms and circles 
 are drawn as one interlocking honeycomb\, and everyone keeps the same colo
 ur and initials everywhere they appear.\n\nIt is a small thing that does r
 eal work. You recognise somebody before you read their name\, and nobody i
 s ever a stranger twice.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
 \n\nFACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nA small design decisi
 on we care about more than we probably should.\n\nIn FAME\, every person i
 s shown as a hexagon\, and your groups sit together as a honeycomb. Everyo
 ne keeps the same colour and the same initials wherever they turn up\, in 
 a circle\, in your contacts\, at a counter.\n\nThe reason is simple. Peopl
 e recognise a shape and a colour faster than they read a name\, and a lot 
 of the people we build for are not reading quickly. Getting that right mea
 ns somebody is never a stranger twice.\n\nalgofame.org\n__________________
 ____________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/c
 ommunity-hive.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
